WEBVTT

00:10:29.079 --> 00:10:32.162
nonbinary people, deaf people,

00:10:32.204 --> 00:10:34.746
LGBTQIA+ people

00:10:34.787 --> 00:10:37.037
and others among us

00:10:37.079 --> 00:10:41.079
that are constantly featured
on the "Come work with us" section

00:10:41.121 --> 00:10:43.246
on company websites,

00:10:43.287 --> 00:10:46.454
we know this harsh reality intimately.

00:10:47.912 --> 00:10:53.287
Being authentic privileges those
already part of the dominant culture.

00:10:54.454 --> 00:10:57.412
It is much easier to be who you are

00:10:57.454 --> 00:10:59.829
when who you are is all around you.